                        'LAST-1..LAST' (default: all)
  --parity {all,odd,even}
                        restrict to odd or even page numbers
  --mode {all,except-fold,edges,from-crop,remove,generate-only}
                        all: same bleed on every edge; except-fold: no bleed
                        on the binding edge; edges: per-edge amounts; from-
                        crop: trim = crop box, bleed = media box; remove:
