  --outside             take the bleed from outside the visible area
                        (previously cropped content); otherwise the bleed is
                        inside the visible page
  --show                make the whole bleed area visible (crop box = bleed
                        box)
  --direction {left,right}
                        binding edge for --mode except-fold (default: left)
  --generate {none,mirror,scale}
                        fill the bleed area: mirror the page edges, or scale
                        the trim area up (default: none)

