  --conform {a-1b,a-2b,a-3b,x-4}
                        save the output as PDF/A (a-1b, a-2b, a-3b: for
                        archiving) or PDF/X-4 (x-4: for printing), made by
                        pdf2iso with Ghostscript, which must be installed
  -q, --quiet           no warnings
  --interface {en,es}   the language of the interface, for this run only (to
                        keep a choice, use the 'interface' command)

marks:
