  -o, --output FILE     the PDF made
  --bookmarks {files,keep,none}
                        one for each file, with its own under it (default);
                        those of the files as they are; or none
  --labels              keep the page labels of each file
  --password PASSWORD   the password of the PDFs, if they have one
.fi
